ilicon.</summary></entry><entry><title>Tech Life</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds/play/w3ct8jyk#2</id><updated>2026-11-08T06:20:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T19:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/sounds/play/w3ct8jyk--fef1a2a6f287.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds/play/w3ct8jyk?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The plan for an orbiting data centre involves linking satellites around Earth.</summary></entry><entry><title>Tech Now</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032yng#3</id><updated>2026-11-08T06:20:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T01:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032yng--a0e77a89b85a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032yng?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Shiona McCallum visits Cairngorms National Park to see tech monitor wildfire damage.</summary></entry><entry><title>Tech Now</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032n6v#3</id><updated>2026-11-08T06:20:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T01:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032n6v--2d0c1972c36b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032n6v?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Alasdair Keane heads to the Pokémon World Championships in San Francisco.</summary></entry><entry><title>Tech Now</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032d9k#3</id><updated>2026-11-08T06:20:58Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T01:00:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032d9k--c78bd9d9cf81.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/m0032d9k?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Ammie Sekhon expl